 class=\"cd-legend__sw\" style=\"background:#a04646\"></span>Compulsory liquidations</li>\n        <li><span class=\"cd-legend__sw\" style=\"background:#b87333\"></span>Administrations</li>\n        <li><span class=\"cd-legend__sw\" style=\"background:#5a6373\"></span>CVAs</li>\n        <li><span class=\"cd-legend__sw\" style=\"background:#b8bcc4\"></span>Receiverships</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <figcaption class=\"cd-figcaption\"><strong>Monthly UK company insolvencies by procedure, England and Wales.</strong> CVLs, compulsory liquidations and administrations are seasonally adjusted where available; CVAs and receivership appointments are not seasonally adjusted due to low volumes. Source: Insolvency Service / Companies House.</figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"cd-section cd-w-wide\" id=\"longrun\">\n  <div class=\"cd-section-head\">\n    <p class=\"cd-eyebrow\">Long-run</p>\n    <h2>Long-run UK company insolvency trends since 2000</h2>\n    <p class=\"cd-section-intro\">Volumes are now close to levels last seen around the 2008\u201309 recession. The rate is lower than the recession peak because the active company register has more than doubled since then.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cd-longrun-grid\">\n    <figure class=\"cd-chart-figure\">\n      <div class=\"cd-chart-panel cd-chart-panel--longrun\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 360\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"chart-longrun-title chart-longrun-desc\" class=\"cd-chart cd-chart--line\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title id=\"chart-longrun-title\">Total monthly company insolvencies, England and Wales, Jan 2000 to Jun 2026</title><desc id=\"chart-longrun-desc\">Long-run line chart of total monthly company insolvencies in England and Wales, seasonally adjusted.</desc><g class=\"cd-chart__grid\"><line x1=\"60\" x2=\"884\" y1=\"312.0\" y2=\"312.0\" stroke=\"#e5e7eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"316.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\" font-variant-numeric=\"tabular-nums\">0</text><line x1=\"60\" x2=\"884\" y1=\"255.2\" y2=\"255.2\" stroke=\"#e5e7eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"259.2\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\" font-variant-numeric=\"tabular-nums\">600</text><line x1=\"60\" x2=\"884\" y1=\"198.4\" y2=\"198.4\" stroke=\"#e5e7eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"202.4\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\" font-variant-numeric=\"tabular-nums\">1,200</text><line x1=\"60\" x2=\"884\" y1=\"141.6\" y2=\"141.6\" stroke=\"#e5e7eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"145.6\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\" font-variant-numeric=\"tabular-nums\">1,800</text><line x1=\"60\" x2=\"884\" y1=\"84.8\" y2=\"84.8\" stroke=\"#e5e7eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"88.8\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\" font-variant-numeric=\"tabular-nums\">2,400</text><line x1=\"60\" x2=\"884\" y1=\"28.0\" y2=\"28.0\" stroke=\"#e5e7eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"32.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\" font-variant-numeric=\"tabular-nums\">3,000</text></g><g class=\"cd-chart__markers\"><line x1=\"343.3\" x2=\"343.3\" y1=\"28\" y2=\"312\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"343.3\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">2008\u201309 recession peak</text><line x1=\"691.6\" x2=\"691.6\" y1=\"28\" y2=\"312\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"691.6\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">Covid support</text><line x1=\"798.2\" x2=\"798.2\" y1=\"28\" y2=\"312\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"798.2\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">Post-Covid CVL peak</text></g><polyline points=\"60.0,184.96 62.6,200.20 65.2,186.47 67.8,193.19 70.4,191.58 73.0,193.67 75.6,186.57 78.2,182.21 80.8,184.67 83.